    <string name="faq_knowledge_base">💡 Ububiko bw\'Ubumenyi bwa AsterDocs</string>
    <string name="faq_knowledge_desc">Shaka ibisubizo ku bibazo bikunze kubazwa ku byerekeye guhindura inyandiko, OCR n\'ibindi.</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">❓ Kuki ntashobora guhitamo cyangwa gukoporora inyandiko zimwe muri za PDF?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Zimwe muri za PDF zakozwe mu mpapuro zasikaniwe cyangwa amafoto. Ukoresha igikoresho cyacu cya OCR mu bice by\'ibikoresho!</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">❓ Kuki inyandiko zimwe zanga gufunguka cyangwa guhinduka?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Inyandiko ishobora kwanga niba:\n• Ifite ijambo ry\'ibanga cyangwa yararinzwe.\n• Dosiye yangiritse.\n\nKura mu nzira ijambo ry\'ibanga mbere yo guhindura.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">❓ Ni gute nshobora gusikana inyandiko nkoresheje kamera cyangwa gallery?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Kanda kuri \'Sikaniro Inyandiko\' ahabanza. Ushobora gufata ifoto cyangwa guhitamo muri gallery.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">🔒 Ese inyandiko zanjye zifite ibanga kandi zikeye?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Yego! Byose bikorerwa ku gikoresho cyawe 100%. Nta nyandiko yoherezwa kuri seriveri.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">🗑️ Nte nshobora kuyobora dosiye cyangwa gusiba ibiri mu byasibwe?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Jya ahabugenewe \'Inyandiko\' maze uhitemo \'Ibyasibwe\'. Kanda \'Kora Isuku mu Byasibwe 🗑️\'.</string>

