    <string name="privacy_policy_message">🔒 Politiki y\'Ibanga n\'Umutekano ya AsterDocs\n\n1. Gutunganyiriza mu Gikoresho:\nIbikorwa byose by\'inyandiko, harimo guhindura PDF, gukuramo inyandiko ya OCR, kugabanya ubunini, guhuza, n\'imyandiko, bikorerwa 100% mu gikoresho cyawe. Nta dosiye y\'inyandiko yoherezwa kuri seriveri zo hanze.\n\n2. Amakuru ya Konti:\nAmazina ya konti yawe n\'ibyo ukunda bikomeye mu banga mu gikoresho cyawe.\n\n3. Uburenganzira n\'Imikoreshereze:\n• Kamera: Ikoreshwa gusa mu gusikana inyandiko igihe ubisabye.\n• Ububiko: Bukoreshwa mu gusoma no kubika dosiye wahisemo.\n\n4. Kwishyura &amp; Kwiyandikisha:\nKwiyandikisha bitunganywa neza binyuze muri Google Play Billing.\n\n5. Gusiba Konti n\'Amakuru:\nUfite uburenganzira bwuzuye ku makuru yawe kandi ushobora gusaba gusiba konti yawe igihe cyose ubishakiye.</string>
